is doing everything to sabotage the courtship. <br /><br />This is a close door romantasy (Romance &amp; fantasy) with fae, magic and banter. It is describe as “A Cozy Fantasy Romance”. This couldn’t be more true! I absolutely loved this story. I loved everything about it. The fashion, the courtships, the traditions and the romance.<br /><br />The charmed leaf series is a favourite and this book is an excellent edition. It's so easy and intriguing that I read it in a day. The atmosphere is magically and mystically. <br /><br />Ave and Bastian story is everything you want in a book. Enemies to friends to lovers , the banter and forced proximity . Bastion brings out the best of Ava. He helps her in more way than one. Ava sees past Bastion’s performance and see the real him. They are perfect for each other.<br /><br />It is amazing to have a smut free series that doesn’t end on a cliffhanger. Rachel Morgan’s writing is amazing and so far I have loved all her books that I have read. I can’t wait to continue the series.<br /><br />#Reading #bookstagrammer#review #southafricanauthor #kindle</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/44389852?shelf=2026-reads" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2026-reads</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/44389852?shelf=e-kindle-own" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">e-kindle-own</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/44389852?shelf=star-5" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">star-5</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="