ruly one of the best writers I have stumbled upon in a long time. So many of her lines are quotable, memorable, and full of wit. She is a phenomenal writer of banter and spice-free romance. But she nails the whimsy and humor side as well. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJust like with Aurelise, I really connected with Aveline. As someone who has been told they are \"too much,\" her story resonated with me. I was cheering her to stand her ground and be who she really is from the beginning. \u003cbr /\u003eBastian was once again a great MC. He falls first is quickly becoming one of my favorite tropes. He loved her so tenderly and so unabashedly. Rachel is once again making it impossible for a real man to ever measure up! :)","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1WWWDDTW9E5LP\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:149351163":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":149351163,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1780975981i/149351163._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":22,"name":"Mizza_CeramanReads","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/149351163-mizza-ceramanreads","contributor":null,"id":149351163},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ARTKIZDQ6QLS8":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ARTKIZDQ6QLS8"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ARTKIZDQ6QLS8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ARTKIZDQ6QLS8","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ARTKIZDQ6QLS8"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/149351163?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8687284816"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2026061503.be300003-9342-4586-bd00-452906d3a342":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2026061503.be300003-9342-4586-bd00-452906d3a342","creator":{"__ref":"User:149351163"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1781495133344,"createdAt":1781494979594,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1781495133181,"text":"This book was a surprise and a half, because I stumbled across it thanks to one of my friends liking a promotional reel made by the author. As someone who hates smut, and has been looking for cosy, non-smut romantasy that isn’t just YA. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis was perfect; with the winter here in Melbourne, a hot chocolate and my fuzzy bathrobe, this delightful book had me squirming in my chair with the giggles, and my dad kept asking me what I was laughing and smiling about! So of course, I went and bought the three main books that are out right away!!!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe characters definitely made this whole book, and got 5 stars from me. The plot, 4 stars, since I didn't really understand what all the opposition from grandma was about. It just didn't make sense, especially how quickly she caved in at the VERY end, after doing all the stupid things she did to force Aveline away from Bastian. And the world-building felt a bit weak for me, so 3 stars; however, I'm sure this will change in the actual books!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, 4 stars!!!","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ARTKIZDQ6QLS8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:129194786":{