es with something real and relatable. In this particular book, Bastian struggled with self worth/comparing himself to others, and Aveline with being herself and not putting on a face. Each characters' growth was something I could relate to in some way, which makes Rachel Morgan's books all the more enjoyable. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am truly loving Morgan's books in this Charmed Leaf Legacy series, and I look forward to reading the next two that have yet to be released.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3TCZB5HK62QIQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:144712949":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":144712949,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":79,"name":"Blitheroo","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/144712949-blitheroo","contributor":null,"id":144712949},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A37ZHCTP5P0AB5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A37ZHCTP5P0AB5"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37ZHCTP5P0AB5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A37ZHCTP5P0AB5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A37ZHCTP5P0AB5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144712949?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8662960948"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2026060604.b24a4384-6ba2-41a8-a47b-b39deb6c04dc":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2026060604.b24a4384-6ba2-41a8-a47b-b39deb6c04dc","creator":{"__ref":"User:144712949"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1780720099786,"createdAt":1780719712692,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1780720099632,"text":"This book is pure, unspiced perfection. I have no notes.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAveline is introduced to us as a perfect debutante, poised and graceful and utterly boring. Her grandmother has tasked her with playing it safe to mend her reputation after a disastrous recoloring incident so she can secure her future husband.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBastian is careless and uncaring, completely allergic to commitment. His mother wants an advantageous marriage while he just wants to enjoy the Revels. This is where their bargain comes in!! But he finds his inner golden retriever energy for Aveline.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book is like a Hallmark Christmas movie (it's even set in winter!!) But with some magic thrown in. Just....a dreamy, romantic feel-good story!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37ZHCTP5P0AB5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:172029972":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":172029972,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1729313749i/172029972._UY200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":209,"name":"tracy ⋆౨ৎ˚⟡˖ ࣪","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/172029972-tracy","contributor":null,"id":172029972},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2G66EDP5D9RSE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2G66EDP5D9RSE"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2G66EDP5D9RSE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"_