 party to boot! \u003cbr /\u003eI loved seeing Bastian fall slowly, and unknowingly, in love with Avaline. I loved watching Avaline finding reasons to trust him, and open up. To me, this was more about Bastian maturing than Avaline coming into her own - the idea that anyone could expect to go through an entire married life together and never be themselves with their husband is crazy. But for Bastian...this was beautiful. I loved it! 5 stars, will definitely read again. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A4GNXKS52Q76K\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:79930287":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":79930287,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":7,"textReviewsCount":929,"name":"Mary Elizabeth","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/79930287-mary-elizabeth","contributor":null,"id":79930287},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1OHQ8AD1LI2B0":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OHQ8AD1LI2B0"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OHQ8AD1LI2B0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1OHQ8AD1LI2B0","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OHQ8AD1LI2B0"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.id60MM8QrttxTJre"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/79930287?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8685627934"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v2.2026061416.22f500c8-1913-48e7-b8cc-7f19783f8122":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.r